396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 269 0 R
/E (The SafeGuard application is a comprehensive personal safety mobile solution designed to provide immediate assistance and protection to users in emergency situations. Developed using React Native and TypeScript, the application integrates modern mobile technologies with essential safety features to ensure quick response during distress scenarios. The primary goal of the system is to enhance personal security by enabling users to send alerts, share their live location, and access emergency services with minimal effort.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 269 0 R
/E (The application incorporates a robust emergency response system that includes a one-tap SOS button with a countdown mechanism, automatic SMS alerts to predefined emergency contacts, and real-time location sharing via GPS. Additional features such as siren activation, hidden camera for evidence collection, and quick dialing of national emergency numbers further strengthen the effectiveness of the system. These functionalities are designed to operate seamlessly even under high-stress conditions, ensuring reliability and ease of use.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
398 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 269 0 R
/E (SafeGuard also includes advanced user-centric features such as fake call simulation, emergency contact management, and customizable settings for alerts and permissions. The application prioritizes user privacy and data security by implementing controlled permission access, secure local storage, and minimal data collection practices. The intuitive user interface, combined with accessibility features like large touch targets and voice feedback, ensures usability for a wide range of users.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
399 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 269 0 R
/E (To further enhance the system, a dedicated admin panel is proposed as an extension of the application. This module enables administrators to monitor user activities, manage emergency alerts, handle complaints, and communicate with users in real time. By integrating backend services such as Firebase, the admin system ensures efficient data handling, quick response to emergencies, and centralized control over the platform.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 269 0 R
/E (In conclusion, SafeGuard represents a powerful integration of mobile technology and safety-oriented design aimed at addressing real-world security challenges. The project demonstrates strong software engineering practices, scalable architecture, and a user-focused approach, making it a reliable and effective solution for personal safety and emergency management.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
