/P 274 0 R
/E (Personal safety has become a major concern due to rising crime rates and delays in emergency response. Traditional methods often fail to provide quick assistance, making it difficult for individuals to seek help during critical situations.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
456 0 obj
<<
