/P 274 0 R
/E (SafeGuard is a mobile-based personal safety application developed using React Native and TypeScript. It provides instant emergency support through features like SOS alerts, live location sharing, and automated communication, all integrated into a single platform.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
457 0 obj
<<
