458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 274 0 R
/E (Ensuring personal safety is often challenging due to the lack of immediate response systems, limited access to emergency services, and dependency on manual communication methods. In critical situations, users may not have enough time to make calls or send messages, leading to delayed assistance. Additionally, existing solutions lack integration of advanced features such as automated alerts, real-time tracking, and centralized monitoring systems.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
459 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 274 0 R
/E (To address these challenges, the proposed system, SafeGuard, provides an intelligent and efficient safety platform that integrates emergency response features with real-time technologies. The system enables users to trigger SOS alerts with a single action, automatically send messages to emergency contacts, and share live location data. It also includes additional features such as fake call simulation, siren alerts, and hidden camera functionality for evidence collection. The inclusion of an admin panel further enhances system efficiency by enabling centralized monitoring and faster response management. This approach improves user safety, reduces response time, and provides a comprehensive solution for modern personal security needs.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
