/E (Several approaches incorporate technologies such as mobile sensors, geolocation services, and cloud-based databases to enhance personal safety. Features like panic buttons, location sharing, and contact alerts have been widely adopted. However, these systems often depend heavily on user interaction and may not function effectively under stress or critical conditions.)
/Pg 21 0 R
