468 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 275 0 R
/E (To overcome these limitations, modern systems are integrating automation and intelligent features such as real-time tracking, instant alerts, and background processing. Research shows that combining multiple safety mechanisms, such as communication tools, evidence collection, and monitoring systems, significantly improves effectiveness. Additionally, the inclusion of centralized admin systems allows better management of user data, emergency handling, and complaint resolution.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
