5095 0 obj
<<
/Title (As a person concerned about personal security, I want to use the SafeGuard application to quickly trigger an SOS alert with a single tap, activating a five-second countdown that automatically sends my real-time GPS location and emergency SMS messages to my trusted contacts while simultaneously enabling stealth evidence collection and a loud siren. This ensures that even in high-stress situations where I cannot manually call for help, my precise location and situation are immediately communicated to responders and family, providing me with a reliable safety net and a deterrent against potential threats.)
/Dest [41 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5078 0 R
/Next 5106 0 R
>>
endobj
